# Secret Systems — environment variable reference
#
# This project is a static site (GitHub Pages). It has no server
# runtime of its own — the only server-side code is the Supabase Edge
# Function `validate-checkout`, which reads its configuration from
# Supabase project secrets (Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets),
# NOT from a .env file that ships with the site. This file documents
# what those secrets are for local reference only. Never put real
# values in this file or commit a real .env anywhere in this repo.
#
# SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are auto-provided to every Edge
# Function by Supabase and do not need to be set manually.

# Optional: enables the validate-checkout function to record a
# lightweight, write-only "order intent" row (package + promo +
# contact info) to the checkout_orders table for owner visibility.
# Without it, checkout validation still works — only that logging
# step is skipped. Get this from Supabase Dashboard → Project
# Settings → API → service_role key. NEVER expose this key in
# browser code — it must only ever be set as an Edge Function secret.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Nothing else is required. Checkout itself happens on HighLevel's
# own hosted checkout pages, configured in ss-checkout-config.js
# (browser-safe URLs only — see that file for the four destinations
# that need to be filled in).
